config BR2_PACKAGE_EXPRESSATT_FIRMWARE
	bool "expressatt-firmware [Galaxy Express]"
	help
	  Firmware plumbing for the Samsung Galaxy Express. Ships no
	  firmware.

	  The WCNSS (RIVA) Wi-Fi image lives on the phone's own `system`
	  partition and its NV calibration on `persist`. Neither may be
	  redistributed, and the calibration is unique to each phone.
	  expressatt-bringup, run by erlinit before Erlang starts, copies
	  them from the read-only stock partitions into /run/firmware,
	  projects the calibration into the layout wcn36xx expects and
	  points the kernel firmware loader there.
